--- !u!114 &963713541
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 963713539}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Ugh. I couldn\u2019t do it. Why couldn\u2019t I do it, Stretch"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Surprised
  - text: "Storm, that\u2019s not you, you\u2019re strong but deep down you\u2019re
      good. You don\u2019t kill"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Blank
  - text: "DAMMIT STRETCH I COULD\u2019VE PUT AN END TO THIS"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: "And you\u2019d never be able to live with yourself. Give yourself a break,
      Storm"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Don\u2019t worry about me"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: "I\u2019m worried more now that you said that, man. I mean it. This loser
      got on your nerves"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "He wasn\u2019t even anything. I got a thousand bucks off him selling him
      the fake sword, then he got his butt handed to him in front of his whole school"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Heh, that was fun.. in a grandly ironic sense
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  - text: "And while he was out, guess what\u2026 Your best friend picked up the
      slack, shoved a tracker down his throat, and recovered-- guess what! A porta-comm!
      He won\u2019t be a threat any more"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: Wow, you really did all that?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: "\u2026 I\u2019m physically incapable of giving less than 100%. It\u2019s
      a character flaw"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "I need you at 100 too. We have a midnight meeting to host\u2026 And we
      can take this radio to you-know-who"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Torch?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Yeah, your boy toy needs a new puzzle
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: Sass
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "Hey now, don\u2019t call him that"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: "All I spit are facts. Anyway despite everything they try to say about
      being untraceable, I\u2019m pretty sure there\u2019s a way of reverse engineering
      them. And I\u2019m SURE we will find something real juicy"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1318935611}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "You know just how to cheer a dojo girl up. C\u2019mere, bestie. I need
      a hug"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 258620331}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
